2025-05-15 20:57:24 [INFO] : 威胁情报已存在于数据库中，跳过：Remote Code Execution with untrusted URI of UDF vulnerability in Apache IoTDB. The attacker who has privilege to create UDF can register malicious function from untrusted URI. This issue affects Apache IoTDB: from 1.0.0 before 1.3.4. Users are recommended to upgrade to version 1.3.4, which fixes the issue.
